WEBVTT

00:15:58.387 --> 00:16:00.869
So I think we were trying
to have those conversations

00:16:00.893 --> 00:16:02.790
and it was a tricky thing to navigate,

00:16:02.814 --> 00:16:05.387
understanding that our product
in the market was space,

00:16:05.411 --> 00:16:06.665
and flexibility in space,

00:16:06.689 --> 00:16:08.879
while still trying to have
a meaningful impact

00:16:08.903 --> 00:16:10.394
on the employee experience.

00:16:10.817 --> 00:16:12.737
AG: Cultural confetti,

00:16:12.761 --> 00:16:17.142
I think in that sense,
it sounds like just a surface layer,

00:16:17.166 --> 00:16:20.198
as opposed to dealing
with the underlying values

00:16:20.222 --> 00:16:22.634
and norms that define what a culture is.

00:16:22.658 --> 00:16:25.934
But the other image
that confetti paints for me,

00:16:25.958 --> 00:16:27.411
at least in my mind,

00:16:27.435 --> 00:16:32.087
is it almost sounds like
it's a weak culture,